An '''inn''' was located on the [[Water|estuary]] [[moon]] of [[Trask]]. A [[Unidentified Mon Calamari server|Mon Calamari server]] worked at the inn. Right after the [[mission to Trask]], [[Din Djarin]] asked the server where to find more [[Mandalorian]]s after paying him and telling him to get [[Trask Chowder]] for [[Din Grogu|Grogu]].<ref name="Chapter 11" />

